----------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party skill packs under sources/
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository aggregates, under `sources/`, methodology files from three
upstream MIT-licensed audit-skills repositories. Each upstream retains its
own copyright notice, preserved verbatim inside `sources/<repo>/LICENSE`:

  sources/pashov/LICENSE       — Copyright (c) 2024 AI Skills Contributors
                                 (https://github.com/pashov/skills)

  sources/plamen/LICENSE        — Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Plamen Contributors
                                 (https://github.com/PlamenTSV/plamen)

  sources/quillshield/LICENSE   — Copyright (c) 2025 QuillShield
                                 (https://github.com/quillai-network/quillshield_skills)

Per the MIT license terms of each upstream, their copyright and permission
notice are retained on all copies or substantial portions of their files.
The full file-level provenance record lives in ATTRIBUTIONS.md.

The aggregation-layer editorial files at this repo's root (README.md,
ATTRIBUTIONS.md, CORRELATIONS.md, and the indexes under library/) are
© 2026 Daoism Systems and released under the same MIT terms above.
